      },
      {
        title: "Who we work with",
        paragraphs: [
          "We work with businesses that already have operations, customers and data — not with ideas still being validated. The range runs from the local company whose contact volume no longer fits on a phone, to the mid-size firm with several legacy systems and nobody holding the full map.",
          "There is no sector restriction: we have worked across hospitality, tourism, health and aesthetics, professional services, retail and software. What does decide the fit is something else — a repeatable process currently consuming people's time, and someone inside with the authority to change it.",
        ],
      },
    ],
    factsTitle: "Company details",
    facts: [
      { label: "Founded", value: FOUNDING_DATE },
      { label: "Based in", value: "Málaga, Spain" },
      { label: "Legal form", value: "Sole trader registered in Spain" },
      { label: "Working languages", value: "Spanish · Portuguese · English" },
      { label: "Coverage", value: "Spain, Portugal and Brazil" },
      { label: "Contact", value: `${CONTACT.email} · ${CONTACT.phoneDisplay}` },
    ],
    outLinksTitle: "Where to go next",
    outLinks: [
      {
        title: "Methodology",
        text: "How we enter a project, what we measure, in what order, and what ships in each phase. It's written down and public.",
        cta: "See the methodology",
        href: "",
      },
      {
        title: "Case studies",
        text: "Projects with context, technical decisions and outcome — including the ones that forced a change of approach midway.",
        cta: "See the portfolio",
        href: "",
      },
      {
        title: PERSON_NAME,
        text: "Automation engineer and founder. Background, focus areas and the articles he signs on the blog.",
        cta: "See the profile",
        href: "",
      },
    ],
    legalTitle: "Legal identification",
    legalText:
      "The legal name, tax ID, registered address and contact email — the information required by article 10 of the Spanish LSSI-CE — are published in a single place on the site so they never drift out of sync.",
    legalCta: "See the legal details",
    legalContact: "For anything else",
    ctaTitle: "Want to talk about your operation?",
    ctaText:
      "Describe the process eating your time today. If it isn't a fit for us, we'll say so in the first conversation.",
    ctaButton: "Email IA Operators",
  },
